{"id":17883,"date":"2023-04-03T15:58:00","date_gmt":"2023-04-03T21:58:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/?post_type=news&#038;p=17883"},"modified":"2025-04-29T19:29:05","modified_gmt":"2025-04-29T23:29:05","slug":"newsletter-april-2023-vol-4-23","status":"publish","type":"news","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/news-events\/newsletter-april-2023-vol-4-23\/","title":{"rendered":"Newsletter: April 2023 (Vol 4.23)"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"17883\" class=\"elementor elementor-17883\" data-elementor-post-type=\"news\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-fd084b3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"fd084b3\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4a7d5a4\" data-id=\"4a7d5a4\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-804d226 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"804d226\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>It&#8217;s finally spring! We hope you&#8217;re enjoying warmer weather wherever you are located! See what Rethink&#8217;s been up to and find out where we&#8217;ll be in April!<\/p><p><br \/><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-15331 alignright\" style=\"max-width: 400px !important;\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/translating-medical-necessity-criteria-aba-providers-rethinkbh.jpg\" alt=\"RethinkBH at APBA conference with Translating Medical Necessity Criteria for ABA Providers\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/translating-medical-necessity-criteria-aba-providers-rethinkbh.jpg 639w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/translating-medical-necessity-criteria-aba-providers-rethinkbh-300x260.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 639px) 100vw, 639px\" \/><\/p><h2>Thanks for joining us at APBA!<\/h2><p>We had a blast at the APBA conference last month!<\/p><p>Thanks to everyone who attended our symposium on <em>Translating Medical Necessity Criteria for ABA Providers<\/em> and who stopped by our booth to say hi!<\/p><p>Check out where we&#8217;ll be next month below.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-f78e647 elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"f78e647\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-11d212c\" data-id=\"11d212c\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-979276e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"979276e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; color: #ffffff;\">Employee Spotlight<\/h2><h3 style=\"margin-top: 15px; color: #ffffff;\">Michael Magne<strong>,<\/strong> <em>Customer Success Manager<\/em><\/h3><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Lives in:<\/strong> Historic Pawtucket, RI<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite food: <\/strong>Buffalo wings. An always with bleu cheese, never ranch. Never.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite singer\/band: <\/strong>There are so many to choose from, but right now I can&#8217;t get enough of Frank Turner and the Sleeping Souls.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite movie: <\/strong> It&#8217;s a toss up between It&#8217;s a Wonderful Life and To Kill a Mockingbird. Or Les Miserables.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>If you could have any super power, what would it be and why?: <\/strong>I&#8217;d like to be able to fly. I love being up in the clouds and then I could go anywhere. Literally, the sky&#8217;s the limit. <\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-0998ff1\" data-id=\"0998ff1\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d2c14c9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d2c14c9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/michael-magne-customer-success-manager-rethinkbh-employee-spotlight.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15333\" alt=\"Michael Magne, Customer Success Manager for RethinkBH, in park\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/michael-magne-customer-success-manager-rethinkbh-employee-spotlight.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/michael-magne-customer-success-manager-rethinkbh-employee-spotlight-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/michael-magne-customer-success-manager-rethinkbh-employee-spotlight-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f960a24 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f960a24\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-15085 alignleft\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/events-newsletter-rethinkbh.png\" alt=\"icon of person on computer monitor with speech bubble\" width=\"100\" height=\"auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/events-newsletter-rethinkbh.png 800w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/events-newsletter-rethinkbh-300x257.png 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/events-newsletter-rethinkbh-768x658.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding-top: 20px\">April 2023 Events<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-e217559 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"e217559\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-998ad70\" data-id=\"998ad70\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-894eb9e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"894eb9e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"348\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/autism-acceptance-awareness-month.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15343\" alt=\"Rainbow infinity symbol for autism acceptance and awareness month\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/autism-acceptance-awareness-month.jpg 760w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/autism-acceptance-awareness-month-300x137.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-3c1df25\" data-id=\"3c1df25\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7fde3b9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7fde3b9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 style=\"margin-top: 0;\">Autism Awareness &amp; Acceptance<\/h3><p>April is Autism Awareness &amp; Acceptance Month! The RethinkBH team is participating in a 1K a Day Challenge to show our support for the autism community. Follow us on social media to see what we&#8217;re doing, and join us in 1K a Day if you feel like being active! Tag us on social media and we&#8217;ll repost you showing your support!<\/p><p>We&#8217;ll also be sharing stories on our <a href=\"https:\/\/open.spotify.com\/show\/5mwABNOCk7yJH2Au02WpdF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ABA After Hours<\/a><span class=\"S1PPyQ\"> podcast about what Autism Awareness &amp; Acceptance means. Throughout the month we will speak with neurodiverse individuals and professionals in the field of ABA! Check out the stories on your preferred podcast platform.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-8d9ddd9 elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"8d9ddd9\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-5f1db95\" data-id=\"5f1db95\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-48290d3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"48290d3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>NEW! Open Training Series<\/h3><p>Rethink has heard you! Based on user feedback and requests, we have a new <a href=\"https:\/\/get.rethinkbh.com\/open-training\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Training Series<\/a> designed to provide ongoing training to users in various areas of the Rethink platform. Each week we provide several training options that users can join to deep dive into the Rethink platform and ask questions live with a trainer.<\/p><p>Bookmark the Open Training Series link above to join when you did to and share with your team!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-ba53415\" data-id=\"ba53415\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d75ebc4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d75ebc4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"670\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/rethinkbh-open-training-series.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15336\" alt=\"Smart phones showing RethinkBH open training series\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/rethinkbh-open-training-series.png 670w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/rethinkbh-open-training-series-300x242.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 670px) 100vw, 670px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-cb76434 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"cb76434\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-5706f09\" data-id=\"5706f09\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2097d77 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2097d77\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/dr-linda-leblanc-rethinkbh-our-next-guest.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15337\" alt=\"Dr. Linda LeBlanc\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/dr-linda-leblanc-rethinkbh-our-next-guest.jpg 800w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/dr-linda-leblanc-rethinkbh-our-next-guest-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/dr-linda-leblanc-rethinkbh-our-next-guest-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/dr-linda-leblanc-rethinkbh-our-next-guest-768x768.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-6ce9063\" data-id=\"6ce9063\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bed57de elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bed57de\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>The Importance of Relationships in the Practice of Behavior Analysis<\/h3><p><strong>April 18th @ 1 pm ET &#8211; 1 Ethics CE!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"_04xlpA direction-ltr align-end para-style-body\"><span class=\"S1PPyQ\">Join <\/span><em><span class=\"S1PPyQ\">Our Next Guest<\/span><\/em><span class=\"S1PPyQ\"> for a conversation with Dr. Linda LeBlanc as we discuss the ethical implications of attending to relationship variables when working with clients and caregivers and recent research identifying the core responses when building therapeutic relationships.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"_04xlpA direction-ltr align-end para-style-body\"><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/importance-relationships-practice-behavior-analysis\/\"><span class=\"S1PPyQ\">Learn More and View On-Demand Webinar<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-620bbb5 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"620bbb5\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[],&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f94f1dd\" data-id=\"f94f1dd\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-841ec23 elementor-widge