 class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-544d845 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"544d845\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 style=\"margin-top: 25px;\">AI in ABA: Why Data Transparency Matters<\/h3><p class=\"_04xlpA direction-ltr align-center para-style-body\"><span class=\"S1PPyQ\">Rethink&#8217;s VP of Data Science, Dr. David J. Cox, recently published a blog on artificial intelligence<\/span> <span class=\"S1PPyQ\">and the importance of data transparency in ABA.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"_04xlpA direction-ltr align-center para-style-body\"><a class=\"S1PPyQ\" draggable=\"false\" href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkfirst.com\/resources\/artificial-intelligence-aba-why-data-transparency-matters\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read post: AI in ABA: Why Data Transparency Matters<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-efc2958 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"efc2958\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-15341 alignleft\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/rethinkbh-survey-ethics-ai-aba-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"QR Code linking to AI in ABA Ethics Survey\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/rethinkbh-survey-ethics-ai-aba-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/rethinkbh-survey-ethics-ai-aba-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/rethinkbh-survey-ethics-ai-aba-768x767.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/rethinkbh-survey-ethics-ai-aba.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" \/><br \/><strong>Interested in joining the conversation?<\/strong><\/p><p>Use the QR link to access a survey on the <a href=\"https:\/\/endicott.qualtrics.com\/jfe\/form\/SV_3CPDsGp37CxSblk?Q_CHL=newsletterresource\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ethics of AI in ABA<\/a> and tell us what you think!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-b602301\" data-id=\"b602301\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b9725bc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b9725bc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 style=\"margin-top: 25px;\">Our Next Guest<\/h3><p><span class=\"S1PPyQ\">Rethink now offers a CE series, <\/span><em><span class=\"S1PPyQ\">Our Next Guest<\/span><\/em><span class=\"S1PPyQ\">. Each month, Dr. Bridget Taylor sits down with experts and professionals in the ABA industry to discuss a variety of topics, from how to discuss sexuality with clients and caregivers, to how to foster <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/making-case-for-diversity-aba\/\">diversity in the workplace<\/a>, and more! <\/span><\/p><p><span class=\"S1PPyQ\">Check out these past guests and head to our <\/span><a class=\"S1PPyQ\" draggable=\"false\" href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/?jsf=jet-engine%3Aposts&amp;tax=resource-type%3A72\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Resources page<\/a><span class=\"S1PPyQ\"